title: Summertime
key: Am
tempo: 100
style: jazz

// Sixteen bars in a minor key: the tonic rocking against its five, the
// four, a minor two-five, the tonic again with the four made a dominant,
// and a last line that goes by the relative major to the tonic in bar
// fifteen, then turns round on the minor two-five.
[A]
| Am6       | E7     | Am6   | %        |
| Dm7       | %      | Bm7b5 | E7       |
| Am6       | E7     | Am6   | D7       |
| Cmaj7 Am7 | Dm7 E7 | Am6   | Bm7b5 E7 |
